0..74 Comment "// What a rose tree refuses. A family nested in another family\'s arguments"
75..147 Comment "// stands below its node only through a parameter the other family holds"
148..224 Comment "// strictly positively, as `List` holds its elements (#517); a parameter its"
225..302 Comment "// family consumes, standing to the left of an arrow in its own field, places"
303..382 Comment "// nothing below the node, and a node over it is a nested occurrence. A measure"
383..461 Comment "// through a list\'s map takes its children at their stage (#393), and the node"
462..538 Comment "// itself at none: handed to `map` in a list of its own, it is not below the"
539..598 Comment "// node\'s stage. Shared with `../../model/data/rose.gandr`."
